Cara Sniffing Live TV di Chrome
1. instal Chrome extension "Network Sniffer"
2. buka website live streaming ( vidio.com, visionplus.id, useetv.com indihometv.com )
3. klik tombol "Network Sniffer"
4. cari link dengan ektensi = ts, m3u, m3u8 atau mpd dkk
5. salam gretongan



